)F FUNCTION -                                                           07522045
   THE COPYDUMP SUBCOMMAND COPIES A DUMP FROM ONE DATA SET TO ANOTHER.  07524045
   COPYDUMP MAKES THE RESULTS OF THE TRANSCRIPTION KNOWN TO A CLIST     07526045
   BY A RETURN CODE, OR MAKES THE RESULTS KNOWN TO THE USER BY ONE      07528045
   OR MORE MESSAGES. THE RETURN CODES GENERATED BY COPYDUMP ARE:        07530045
                                                                        07532045
    0 = END OF FILE REACHED.  THE INPUT DATA SET HAS BEEN CLOSED,       07534045
        AND A DUMP HAS BEEN COPIED TO THE OUTPUT DATA SET.              07536045
    4 = END OF DUMP REACHED. THE INPUT DATA SET HAS BEEN LEFT OPEN,     07538045
        POSITIONED IMMEDIATELY AFTER THE DUMP COPIED BY THIS            07540045
        THIS SUBCOMMAND TO THE OUTPUT DATA SET.                         07542045
    8 = END OF FILE REACHED PRIOR TO REACHING THE DUMP TO BE COPIED.    07544045
        THE INPUT DATA SET HAS BEEN CLOSED, AND ANY OUTPUT DATA SET     07546045
        HAS NOT BEEN ALTERED.                                           07548045
   12 = COPYDUMP PROCESSING WAS TERMINATED.  THE INPUT DATA SET HAS     07550045
        BEEN CLOSED, AND ANY OUTPUT DATA SET HAS NOT BEEN ALTERED.      07552045
   16 = COPYDUMP PROCESSING WAS TERMINATED AFTER DETECTION OF A         07554045
        PROBLEM IN THE IPCS EXECUTION ENVIRONMENT.                      07556045
   20 = COPYDUMP PROCESSING WAS TERMINATED.  THE INPUT DATA SET HAS     07558045
        BEEN CLOSED, AND THE OUTPUT DATA SET HAS BEEN LOADED WITH PART  07560045
        OF A DUMP.                                                      07562045
   24 = COPYDUMP PROCESSING WAS TERMINATED.  THE INPUT DATA SET HAS     07564045
        BEEN LEFT OPEN, AND THE OUTPUT DATA SET HAS NOT BEEN ALTERED.   07566045
                                                                        07574045
   REQUIRED OPERANDS - OUTDATASET, OUTFILE, OR SKIP(EOF)                07576045
   DEFAULT - INFILE(IPCSINDD), NOSKIP                                   07578045
